{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plunge into the gloomy atmosphere of the Middle Ages, where you begin your journey as a healer fighting deadly diseases and a plague epidemic! The demo will introduce you to the town of Ludwig and some of its inhabitants, who are unlucky enough to live in such a difficult time... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The town has yet to face the plague and is living its life, unaware that the deadly epidemic is near! As chief scientist, you will have to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">diagnose and treat various diseases;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">buy prescriptions and prepare medicines;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">enforce bans at the first sign of an epidemic;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">familiarize yourself with the combat system and its modes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">face the consequences of your medical decisions and restrictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653580/extras/FightEng.gif?t=1744878214\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version you will find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">an introduction to the events in the city before the arrival of the epidemic; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the first two chapters of the game; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 different patients with their own stories and impact on life in the city;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the opportunity to prepare 2-3 preparations and try them out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the city's last hope before impending disaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653580/extras/DistillerEng.gif?t=1744878214\" /></p>","background":"https:/